  "slug": "sop-standard-operating-procedure-for-real-unique-processes",
  "name": "Sop Standard Operating Procedure For Real Unique Processes",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "An SOP is structured, executable instructions for a repeatable process. Think of it as a skill file for a human or AI agent — it should be complete enough that the executor (person or agent) can follow it cold, without asking anyone for help, and produce a consistent result every time.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `sop` (Write, create, update, maintain, and audit Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) — for humans or AI agents), `write-changelog-readme` (Creates and updates CHANGELOG, README using standard templates).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sop-standard-operating-procedure-for-real-unique-processes@claude-community` from `mdiener21/skills`.",
